    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lone.AI is a space RPG roguelite. With challenging, relentless gameplay, each run has the potential to boost your ship's power, speed, and more. As a lone AI, fight your way through the solar system and uncover the secret behind the ZOSMA, an alien race that holds power over the system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Fight!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to defend yourself against a relentless onslaught of various enemy types. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/f1f9b779d6fdc656fa382e92798357de.poster.avif?t=1753427949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/f1f9b779d6fdc656fa382e92798357de.webm?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/f1f9b779d6fdc656fa382e92798357de.mp4?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Abilities</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get started after undocking by selecting a run ability that can be upgraded later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/7c0457b58605a6006e034a7f75465fb4.poster.avif?t=1753427949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/7c0457b58605a6006e034a7f75465fb4.webm?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/7c0457b58605a6006e034a7f75465fb4.mp4?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Skill Tree and Stats</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain skill points to purchase unique skills that can change between runs. Stat points can be used to boost specific base stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/f18e04993ecafca5ff0f433d650513a5.poster.avif?t=1753427949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/f18e04993ecafca5ff0f433d650513a5.webm?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Modules</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of modules that alter your combat style. Dropped modules can be rerolled to refine and perfect your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/aa7619e98692432e13d33f8a5f14efef.poster.avif?t=1753427949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/aa7619e98692432e13d33f8a5f14efef.webm?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/aa7619e98692432e13d33f8a5f14efef.mp4?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Shops</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect credits and cargo to trade, sell, or utilize for upgrades at different shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/21b9457e0cbec0426eb92a2ee36892fd.poster.avif?t=1753427949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/21b9457e0cbec0426eb92a2ee36892fd.webm?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/21b9457e0cbec0426eb92a2ee36892fd.mp4?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Builds</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of different builds possible to suit many playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/470a5e6f8bc6fd063e130e051dce24e8.poster.avif?t=1753427949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/470a5e6f8bc6fd063e130e051dce24e8.webm?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/470a5e6f8bc6fd063e130e051dce24e8.mp4?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>More Features included in lone.AI</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore the solar system to discover hidden locations, different types of shops, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Visit different planets to complete missions and interact with various alien species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Acquire a high bounty that attracts dangerous bounty hunters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Gameplay that poses many challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Compete to reach the top of the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Controller Support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-34 Steam Achievements </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lone.AI is easy to learn but hard to master. Upon undocking, you commence with a basic AI ship. Soon, enemies attack from every direction, prompting you to defend yourself to survive and acquire loot. Loot includes credits, cargo, modules, and more. Utilize credits and cargo to trade or purchase more upgrades for your ship. Some upgrades are temporary for the current run, while others are permanent and persist across all runs. Modules offer specific effects but only last for the duration of the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run concludes upon either defeat, or victory against the boss, the alien mothership appearing at the end of your run time of 1000. Upon defeat, you can submit your high scores and start anew with any newly acquired upgrades. Victory against the boss grants you triumph. Post-victory, the game intensifies in various ways, potentially unlocking new upgrades to aid you against heightened challenges. With increased difficulty comes the opportunity for higher scores, propelling you to compete for the top spot on the leaderboards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lone.AI is a space RPG roguelite. With challenging, relentless gameplay, each run has the potential to boost your ship's power, speed, and more. As a lone AI, fight your way through the solar system and uncover the secret behind the ZOSMA, an alien race that holds power over the system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Fight!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to defend yourself against a relentless onslaught of various enemy types. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/f1f9b779d6fdc656fa382e92798357de.poster.avif?t=1753427949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/f1f9b779d6fdc656fa382e92798357de.webm?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/f1f9b779d6fdc656fa382e92798357de.mp4?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Abilities</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get started after undocking by selecting a run ability that can be upgraded later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/7c0457b58605a6006e034a7f75465fb4.poster.avif?t=1753427949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901990/extras/7c0457b58605a6006e034a7f75465fb4.webm?t=1753427949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse